shiji-052-qidaohui","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p027","quote":"厲王"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","source_id":"s-shiji-052-qidaohui","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p026","quote":"齊初圍急，陰與三國通謀，約未定，會聞路中大夫從漢來，喜，及其大臣乃復勸王毋下三國。居無何，漢將欒布、平陽侯等兵至齊，擊破三國兵，解齊圍。已而復聞齊初與三國有謀，將欲移兵伐齊。齊孝王懼，乃飲藥自殺。景帝聞之，以為齊首善，以迫劫有謀，非其罪也，乃立孝王太子壽為齊王，是為懿王，續齊後。而膠西、膠東、濟南、菑川王咸誅滅，地入于漢。徙濟北王王菑川。齊懿王立二十二年卒，子次景立，是為厲王。","source_term":"子次景立"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji052-010","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"qok_ik2_99j"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p003254"]},{"id":"uxz_hc8_v82","label":"紀太后（齊悼惠王世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"紀太后","mention_ids":["c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m027-0007","c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m028-0129"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m027-0007","chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p027","quote":"紀太后"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m028-0129","chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p028","quote":"紀太后"}],"id_aliases":["cbr-p003255"]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-052-qidaohui","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-052","chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","mention_count":3,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m027-0043","c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m027-0073","c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m029-0132"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p027","c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p029"],"passage_count":2}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-052-qidaohui"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-shij