翁主姦。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m027-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"齊厲王","kind":"person","person_id":"qok_ik2_99j_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m027-0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"紀太后","kind":"person","person_id":"uxz_hc8_v82","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m027-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"太后","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"集體、官稱、未名者或待核回指；不補姓名，王作動詞不當人名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m027-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"其弟","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"集體、官稱、未名者或待核回指；不補姓名，王作動詞不當人名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m027-0016","start":16,"end":19,"surface":"紀氏女","kind":"person","person_id":"slm_sf2_yss","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m027-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"厲王","kind":"person","person_id":"qok_ik2_99j_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m027-0024","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"集體、官稱、未名者或待核回指；不補姓名，王作動詞不當人名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m027-0027","start":27,"end":30,"surface":"紀氏女","kind":"person","person_id":"slm_sf2_yss","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m027-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"太后","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"集體、官稱、未名者或待核回指；不補姓名，王作動詞不當人名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m027-0043","start":43,"end":46,"surface":"紀翁主","kind":"person","person_id":"er5_u4u_i79","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m027-0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"集體、官稱、未名者或待核回指；不補姓名，王作動詞不當人名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m027-0059","start":59,"end":60,"surface":"王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresol